      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered near closure by improving symptoms, residual insulin uncertainty, and pending vulvar/pathology follow-up. The doctor bounded the overnight acute issue, assigned endocrine review for the next day, and reattached the vulvar/pathology thread to offline clinicians with family receipt, though not perfectly comprehensively.",
