          "explanation": "Doctor reinforced not sleeping on an empty stomach.",
          "quote": "一定不要空着肚子睡觉"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by the family’s belief that she should avoid eating because of possible later testing or treatment. The doctor corrected the practical danger indirectly by linking missed food plus insulin to hypoglycemia and telling them not to sleep hungry, but did not explicitly correct the fasting-for-future-procedure misconception as a separate teach-back point beyond minimum hypoglycemia management.",
