          "quote": "体温超过38℃、心慌一直不缓解或者肿块突然再次明显肿痛，需要尽快到急诊就诊。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor asked about urine and bowel changes, but the broader red-flag screen remained incomplete.",
          "quote": "排尿排便正常吗？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was only partially met. The doctor did not collapse the case into reassurance and did screen fever, local worsening, and urine/bowel issues, but did not adequately cover medication allergy symptoms, purulent/foul drainage, persistent vomiting, or abdominal pain as required for this concurrent vulvar/antibiotic risk thread.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
