          "explanation": "Doctor recognized antibiotic adherence as relevant but did not reconcile name, dose, timing, or allergy history.",
          "quote": "有没有按时吃抗生素"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00130",
          "explanation": "Doctor directed medication boxes/prescription review for insulin planning, but did not explicitly close the antibiotic medication gap.",
          "quote": "您带好药盒和原处方过去"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00194",
          "explanation": "Doctor appropriately set insulin self-adjustment boundaries.",
          "quote": "问过原医院内分泌医生后再决定"
        }
      ],
