        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00255",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledged that pathology/further management remained pending.",
          "quote": "等待后续处理和病理"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met at a minimum level: the doctor did not treat pain improvement as closure and directed next-day clinician review of the vulvar mass/pain and pending pathology, although the follow-up chain could have been more detailed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00130",
