          "quote": "睡前先看一次患者状态"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00255",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirmed next-day owner priorities and action sequence.",
          "quote": "明天去复核胰岛素方案是首要的"
        }
      ],
